# WP-FAR-15 (folds NET-RELEVANCY): replication by distance for World Partition. A pawn is relevant by its POINT in
# the connection's view shape (the client's own streaming source shape reported as ViewReport, else the circle of
# Net.PawnCullRangeCm), not by its cell in the main grid's LoadingRange; it leaves only past that shape widened by
# WorldPartition.UnloadMargin (hysteresis). Each relevant pawn is sent every EverySteps of its distance band
# (Config/Engine.json "Net", Project::NetSettings; UE NetUpdateFrequency / ReplicationPeriodFrame), an unchanged pawn
# every DormantEverySteps, due pawns sorted by priority inside a per-connection byte budget; each snapshot entry
# carries its period, and the client draws each pawn behind its own interpolation delay
# (Net::PawnInterpolationDelay, extrapolation capped by Net::PawnExtrapolationCap).
# Played by scripts/Dev/net_scenario.py through play_scenario.py (NET-SCENARIO-PLAY, as NET-4/NET-REMOTE): DesertServer
# --role all on WP_Protocol with a 30 ms jitter on its send link, observer A = Editor (--shot-player-view, every frame
# recorded), bots B, C (and D for far15_dormant) = DesertNetProbe --bot, every client on a 75 ms / 2 % link (NET-5).
# Placement: the server console `teleport <player> <x> <y> <z>` puts each bot relative to A's own position as the
# server logs it ("player N account K (x, y, z)", Y-up, feet). The bots stand along -Z from A, not +X: A's player view
# looks down -Z from its spawn (NET-REMOTE: a pawn at spawn z - 500 is "5 m ahead" in A's view), so B and C are in
# A's frame. They are dropped from 3 m / 20 m above A's height and fall onto the ground. B and C walk a circle
# (--turn-deg-s 36, a walk long enough for the whole run). Settings = NetSettings defaults (50 m/30 Hz, 150 m/15 Hz,
# 400 m/6 Hz, beyond 3 Hz; circle 500 m; margin 0.25 -> exit at 625 m).
# Numbers that must agree: 300 m -> period 10; 20 m -> period 2; exit only past 625 m; C's delay = 2 x 167 ms +
# jitter ~ 0.35-0.50 s; 0 snap.
Мир Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Роль server server lag=75 jitter=30 loss=2 --role all --source 0,0,0 --pawn assets:Prefabs/Pawn_Player.deprefab --spawn 0,92,650 --spawn 0,92,150 --spawn 300,92,150 --spawn -300,92,150 --steps 1000000
Ждать server 60 \[Server\] listening on port
Роль A editor account=1 lag=75 loss=2 --play --shot-frames 100000 --shot-every 1 --shot-player-view --quality PostProcess.MotionBlurQuality=0
Ждать A 1800 \[Net\] in session
Роль B bot account=2 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Роль C bot account=3 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 15000 --walk-cm 100000000 --turn-deg-s 36
Ждать server 60 player \d+ account 3 \(
Запомнить a server player (\d+) account 1 \((-?\d+), (-?\d+), (-?\d+)\)
Запомнить b server player (\d+) account 2 \(
Запомнить c server player (\d+) account 3 \(
Консоль server teleport {b1} {a2} {a3+300} {a4-2000}
Ждать server 30 player \d+: pawn \d+ teleported to
Консоль server teleport {c1} {a2} {a3+2000} {a4-30000}
Ждать server 30 player \d+: pawn \d+ teleported to
